    1,
    1
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NONE",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route110_EventScript_14F9B0",
   "texts": {
    "Route110_Text_16EBC9": "Oh, hey, you got that BIKE from RYDEL!\\pOh, it's glaringly obvious.\\nIt says right on your bike...\\pRYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL,\\nRYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL,\\pRYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL,\\nRYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL,\\pRYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL,\\nRYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL,\\pRYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL,\\nRYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL,\\pRYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL, RYDEL...\\nThat name's everywhere.\\pYou should ride it around all over\\nthe place - it's good advertising!$"
   }
  },
  {
   "local_id": 5,
   "x": 10,
   "y": 11,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_OLD_MAN_1",
   "movement": "MOVEMENT_TYPE_WANDER_AROUND",
   "range": [
    1,
    1
   ],
   "trainer_type": "TRAINER_TYPE_NONE",
   "hide_flag": "0",
   "script": "Route110_EventScript_14F9B9",
   "texts": {
    "Route110_Text_16EDC5": "The two roads, one above, one below...\\pA road each for people and POKéMON.\\nPerhaps that is right and fair.$"
   }
  },
  {
   "local_id": 6,
   "x": 27,
   "y": 24,
   "gfx": "OBJ_EVENT_GFX_CYCLING_TRIATHLETE_F",
